     "results": {
      "about": {
       "ops": [
        {
         "insert": "Best Bridal Lehenga Designs For Women"
        },
        {
         "attributes": {
          "header": 2
         },
         "insert": "\n"
        },
        {
         "insert": "Indian weddings are more than mere celebrations; they are once-in-a-lifetime experiences filled with love, laughter, fun, thrill and emotions. This special day in every woman’s life becomes more special when she walks down the aisle in her favourite bridal lehenga made specially for her. Lehenga is a traditional Indian outfit for women that consists of a long, flowy, & voluminous skirt, a sleek fit blouse & a trendy yet traditional dupatta. Lehengas are often made in the most luxurious fabrics in India including silk, velvet, net, georgette, chiffon and many more. Further, the heavy bridal lehengas are usually embellished with zari and threadwork. Stones, beads, mirrors and sequins turn these lehengas into the most magical outfits. \n\nWeddings By Betterhalf have come up with an exclusive ideabook featuring trending and latest bridal lehenga designs for you. Browse the list & bookmark your favourite ones today!\n\nWhich Are The Trending Bridal Wedding Lehenga Styles?"
        },
        {
         "attributes": {
          "header": 2
         },
         "insert": "\n"
        },
        {
         "insert": "Wedding fashion is celebrated in India. Designers work day and night to create the best wedding outfits for Indian couples to look mesmerising at their wedding ceremony. The Dulhan lehenga is one of the most talked about wedding outfits. After all, have we all not dreamt about our wedding lehenga forever? While we have all been dreaming about it, different women have different preferences when it comes to their lehenga. Look at the most popular styles from simple bridal lehenga to traditional ones. \n\n"
        },
